      "id": "claim_8a9be04572ba44408ee09ff9e2dc7d3b",
      "statement": "packages/shared/src/protocol.ts is the source of truth for every cross-package wire shape; servers/mcp/src/protocol.ts mirrors/forwards those shapes and defines MCP-only result types but does not redefine the relay/extension wire types, so cross-package changes must start in the shared package and be updated across the relay, MCP server, and extensions together.",
      "evidence": [
