    {
      "id": "claim_30e990185dfb4f0eb671a7c67199873b",
      "statement": "All relayed messages use a single WebSocketEnvelope with type 'message', optional string id (request/response correlation), optional target (browserInstanceId for multi-browser routing, tabId for multi-tab routing), and an opaque payload discriminated by payload.type; parseBrijioEnvelope validates this shape and returns a structured BrijioErrorEnvelope (invalid_json/invalid_message) instead of throwing.",
