    {
      "id": "claim_52d4cd71d5c54126998bc98e6c8532bb",
      "statement": "pageContextId/pageContextVersion is a module-scoped counter in the content script (CONTENT_SCRIPT_VERSION = 2) incremented on every pageshow navigation event; extract_page_context stamps the returned PageContext with the current pageContextId, and handleContentRequest returns a page_navigated error with a StaleContextDetail (previousContextId/currentContextId) when an action request's pageContextId no longer matches pageContextVersion. ADR 0043 made content-script re-injection idempotent (the script stores its pageshow listener on globalThis and removes the previous one before adding its own) so this counter does not drift across duplicate listeners.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/architecture/decisions/0043-idempotent-content-script-injection.md#L1-L57",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f3de4bb9064f769e2d6c60400367972bed26ff03151e33498153a5f1c5b32d67:"
