      "id": "claim_916cda3182aa42618e028bdbcb663de8",
      "statement": "The action-approval protocol (ADR 0048) gates a hardcoded set of browser-mutating operations — submit_form, fetch_resource, and download_file — behind explicit in-browser user approval; the gated set is hardcoded in getApprovalActionType in packages/shared/src/background-controller.ts, kept behind that one function so policy can later delegate to local or enterprise configuration.",
