    {
      "id": "claim_83946a21068445c7a18daf65b6fde55e",
      "statement": "Approval-gated operations carry a unique actionUUID and approvalRequest:true via the shared ApprovalMetadata interface; for perform_batch every batch action carries an actionUUID while only approval-gated items additionally carry approvalRequest:true. The envelope id remains the request/response correlation key while actionUUID identifies one action within a request or batch; isPerformActionEnvelope/isBatchAction validate actionUUID (non-empty string when present) and approvalRequest (boolean) via hasValidApprovalMetadata.",
      "evidence": [
