    {
      "id": "claim_f09743e680a1463089d5253fa6fcac76",
      "statement": "The shared BrijioErrorCode union (packages/shared/src/protocol.ts, the authoritative set the WS server and extension emit, including invalid_json, invalid_message, unsupported_action, and the upload/download/fetch codes) and the MCP server's own narrower BrijioErrorCode union (for constructing local responses: connection_failed, invalid_response, browser_error, stale_context, page_navigated, invalid_resource_uri, unsupported_scheme) are deliberately out of sync: the MCP union is for construction, the shared union is for emission, and forwarding bridges them. Trying to make them identical reintroduces the bug ADR 0061 removed.",
