      "id": "claim_3d107c7ab81140f389f863373b1aedb1",
      "statement": "Staged file uploads stream a file to the extension before an upload_file action references it via a start/chunk/complete handshake keyed by uploadId: stage_file_upload_start (file metadata, chunkSize, totalChunks), stage_file_upload_chunk (index, dataBase64), stage_file_upload_complete (optional sha256), stage_file_upload_staged/stage_file_upload_ack acknowledgements, and stage_file_upload_error with a typed error code (invalid_file_payload, checksum_mismatch, file_too_large, invalid_file_name, invalid_file_type, upload_expired).",
