      "id": "claim_0e16242c883e4329b4b38c0bb20441ae",
      "statement": "Download/fetch status uses DownloadInfo (kind 'download') and FetchResourceInfo (kind 'fetch') over a shared DownloadState of in_progress/complete/interrupted (fetch adds 'streaming'); DownloadStatusRequest (type 'download_status', optional ids/browserInstanceId) returns DownloadStatusResponse with capability 'full'|'not_supported' and items, or DownloadStatusErrorResponse. DownloadFileRequest and FetchResourceRequest both extend ApprovalMetadata and initiate browser downloads or streamed fetches; fetch streams back fetch_resource_start/chunk(s)/complete (sha256, totalBytes) or fetch_resource_error.",
